  "question": {
    "text": "The figure shows a fixed incline plane on which a plank is being pulled upwards such that the centre&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> of the solid cylinder remains at rest with respect to ground. If&nbsp;no slipping takes place between the cylinder and the plank, then the acceleration of&nbsp;the plank is<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0030262_Question.jpg\" style=\"width: 238px; height: 168px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
